  {
   "id": 536617,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Some of Newton’s predecessors and contemporaries also studied gravity and proposed theories. What important advance did Newton make in the study of gravity that the other scientists had failed to do?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1052651,
     "content_html": "He gave an exact mathematical form for the theory."
    },
    {
     "id": 1052652,
     "content_html": "He added a correction term to a previously existing formula."
    },
    {
     "id": 1052653,
     "content_html": "Newton found the value of the universal gravitational constant."
    },
    {
     "id": 1052654,
     "content_html": "Newton showed that gravitational force is always attractive."
    }
   ],
